accTitle: Scale web capacity and database reads separately
accDescr: The web Auto Scaling group shares session state, sends writes to one writer, and sends read connections to an independently scaled reader pool.
U["User requests"] --> A["Application Load Balancer"]
A --> W["EC2 Auto Scaling group"]
W <--> S[("Shared session store")]
W -->|Writes| P["Aurora writer endpoint"]
W -->|Read-only connections| R["Aurora reader endpoint"]
P --> DB[("Writer")]
R --> RP[("Aurora Replica pool")]
AS["Aurora Auto Scaling"] -->|Add or remove readers| RP
DB -->|Replicated changes| RP
class U inputData
